@*
    ── ניהול משתמשים (Admin Users management) ───────────────────────────────
    Route:  /management/users  — reached from the ניהול hub
            (LecturerManagementPage → "משתמשים והרשאות" → "משתמשים").

    Visual source:
        design-reference/Motiva Admin Users.dc.html

    WHAT WAS TAKEN FROM THE REFERENCE, AND WHAT WAS NOT
    ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
    Taken: the composition (title + summary + two actions / one toolbar row /
    one full-width table), the density, the identity treatment (initials disc +
    strong name + restrained secondary values), the semantic dot-and-text
    status, the filter pills with their "name: value" shape, and the kebab row
    menu.

    NOT taken: the prototype's entire outer shell — its own logo, top nav,
    profile cluster, page background and rounded application frame. Admin
    already resolves to the canvas shell in AppLayout (MotivaTopNav on the
    washed canvas), so this page renders CONTENT ONLY. There is no second nav,
    no second logo and no second frame here.

    NOT taken either: every user, role, cycle, status, phone and count in the
    prototype. All of it is mock. Everything below comes from
    IAuthenticationService.GetUsersByRoles("") → GET api/Admin.

    WHERE THE REAL MODEL DIFFERS FROM THE PROTOTYPE
    ───────────────────────────────────────────────
    • STATUS. The prototype draws three (פעיל / ממתין להפעלה / מושבת).
      UserForAdmin exposes `bool IsActive` and nothing else — the API does not
      return a verification/pending flag — so this screen draws TWO. The third
      is not invented.
    • CYCLE. The prototype's תשפ"ו/תשפ"ה are mock. users.AcademicYear is a free
      string ("2025-2026"), so the cycle filter's options are DERIVED from the
      values actually present in the loaded set — never a hardcoded list.
    • DELETE. The prototype's "מחיקת משתמש" has no production counterpart:
      there is no delete endpoint on AdminController or anywhere else. The item
      is therefore absent from the kebab rather than drawn as a dead action.

    LOADING / FILTERING SEMANTICS ARE UNCHANGED
    ───────────────────────────────────────────
    One unpaged GET on init, then search and all three filters run client-side
    over that list — exactly as before. Nothing moved to or from the server.
*@

@page "/management/users"
@layout AppLayout
@attribute [Authorize(Roles = Roles.Admin)]
@using AuthWithAdmin.Shared.AuthSharedModels
@using AuthWithAdmin.Client.ClientHelpers
@inject NavigationManager Nav
@inject IAuthenticationService _Auth

@* ══════════════════════════════════════════
     CREATE USER MODAL
     ══════════════════════════════════════════ *@
@if (_createOpen)
{
    <div class="um-modal-overlay" @onclick="CancelCreate">
        <div class="um-modal-box" @onclick:stopPropagation="true">
            <div class="um-modal-header">
                <div>
                    <div class="um-modal-title">הוספת משתמש חדש</div>
                    <div class="um-modal-subtitle">הסיסמה תישלח למייל המשתמש</div>
                </div>
                <button type="button" class="um-modal-close" @onclick="CancelCreate" title="סגירה" aria-label="סגירה">
                    <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                         stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true">
                        <path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12" />
                    </svg>
                </button>
            </div>

            <div class="um-modal-body">
                <div class="um-form-row">
                    <div class="um-form-field">
                        <label class="um-form-label">שם פרטי *</label>
                        <input class="um-form-input" @bind="_createFirstName" placeholder="ישראל" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="um-form-field">
                        <label class="um-form-label">שם משפחה *</label>
                        <input class="um-form-input" @bind="_createLastName" placeholder="ישראלי" />
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="um-form-field">
                    <label class="um-form-label">כתובת מייל *</label>
                    <input class="um-form-input" @bind="_createEmail" placeholder="user@example.com" dir="ltr" type="email" />
                </div>
                <div class="um-form-row">
                    <div class="um-form-field">
                        <label class="um-form-label">טלפון</label>
                        <input class="um-form-input" @bind="_createPhone" placeholder="050-0000000" dir="ltr" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="um-form-field">
                        <label class="um-form-label">שנת לימודים</label>
                        <MSelectField Options="@AcademicYearOptions"
                                      @bind-Value="@_createYear"
                                      Class="um-form-select" />
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="um-form-field">
                    <label class="um-form-label">תפקיד *</label>
                    <MSelectField Options="@RoleSelectOptions"
                                  @bind-Value="@_createRole"
                                  Class="um-form-select" />
                </div>

                @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(_createError))
                {
                    <div class="um-form-error">@_createError</div>
                }

                @if (_createSuccess)
                {
                    <div class="um-form-success">המשתמש נוצר בהצלחה — נשלח מייל עם הגדרת סיסמה</div>
                }
            </div>

            <div class="um-modal-footer">
                <button type="button" class="um-btn-ghost" @onclick="CancelCreate" disabled="@_createSaving">ביטול</button>
                <button type="button" class="um-btn-primary motiva-cta" @onclick="SaveCreate" disabled="@_createSaving">
                    @if (_createSaving)
                    {
                        <span class="um-spinner-sm" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    }
                    הוספה
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
}

@* ══════════════════════════════════════════
     EDIT USER MODAL
     ══════════════════════════════════════════ *@
@if (_editUser is not null)
{
    <div class="um-modal-overlay" @onclick="CancelEdit">
        <div class="um-modal-box" @onclick:stopPropagation="true">
            <div class="um-modal-header">
                <div>
                    <div class="um-modal-title">עריכת משתמש</div>
                    <div class="um-modal-subtitle" dir="ltr">@_editUser.Email</div>
                </div>
                <button type="button" class="um-modal-close" @onclick="CancelEdit" title="סגירה" aria-label="סגירה">
                    <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                         stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true">
                        <path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12" />
                    </svg>
                </button>
            </div>

            <div class="um-modal-body">
                <div class="um-form-row">
                    <div class="um-form-field">
                        <label class="um-form-label">שם פרטי</label>
                        <input class="um-form-input" @bind="_editFirstName" placeholder="שם פרטי" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="um-form-field">
                        <label class="um-form-label">שם משפחה</label>
                        <input class="um-form-input" @bind="_editLastName" placeholder="שם משפחה" />
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="um-form-row">
                    <div class="um-form-field">
                        <label class="um-form-label">טלפון</label>
                        <input class="um-form-input" @bind="_editPhone" placeholder="050-0000000" dir="ltr" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="um-form-field">
                        <label class="um-form-label">שנת לימודים</label>
                        <MSelectField Options="@AcademicYearOptions"
                                      @bind-Value="@_editYear"
                                      Class="um-form-select" />
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="um-form-field">
                    <label class="um-form-label">תפקיד</label>
                    <MSelectField Options="@RoleSelectOptions"
                                  @bind-Value="@_editRole"
                                  Class="um-form-select" />
                </div>

                @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(_editError))
                {
                    <div class="um-form-error">@_editError</div>
                }
            </div>

            <div class="um-modal-footer">
                <button type="button" class="um-btn-ghost" @onclick="CancelEdit" disabled="@_editSaving">ביטול</button>
                <button type="button" class="um-btn-primary motiva-cta" @onclick="SaveEdit" disabled="@_editSaving">
                    @if (_editSaving)
                    {
                        <span class="um-spinner-sm" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    }
                    שמירה
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
}

@* ══════════════════════════════════════════
     RESET PASSWORD — confirmation
     Wraps the EXISTING production flow (IAuthenticationService.ForgetPassword
     → GET api/users/ForgotPassword), which mails the user a reset link. No new
     endpoint, no admin-set password: the confirmation exists because the action
     sends real mail to a real person and is not undoable.
     ══════════════════════════════════════════ *@
@if (_resetUser is not null)
{
    <div class="um-modal-overlay" @onclick="CloseReset">
        <div class="um-modal-box um-modal-box--sm" @onclick:stopPropagation="true">
            <div class="um-modal-header">
                <div>
                    <div class="um-modal-title">איפוס סיסמה</div>
                    <div class="um-modal-subtitle">@FullName(_resetUser)</div>
                </div>
                <button type="button" class="um-modal-close" @onclick="CloseReset" title="סגירה" aria-label="סגירה">
                    <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                         stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true">
                        <path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12" />
                    </svg>
                </button>
            </div>

            <div class="um-modal-body">
                <p class="um-modal-text">
                    יישלח קישור להגדרת סיסמה חדשה לכתובת
                    <span class="um-modal-email" dir="ltr">@_resetUser.Email</span>.
                    הסיסמה הנוכחית תישאר בתוקף עד שהמשתמש יגדיר חדשה.
                </p>

                @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(_resetError))
                {
                    <div class="um-form-error">@_resetError</div>
                }
                @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(_resetSuccess))
                {
                    <div class="um-form-success">@_resetSuccess</div>
                }
            </div>

            <div class="um-modal-footer">
                <button type="button" class="um-btn-ghost" @onclick="CloseReset" disabled="@_resetSending">סגירה</button>
                @if (string.IsNullOrEmpty(_resetSuccess))
                {
                    <button type="button" class="um-btn-primary motiva-cta" @onclick="SendReset" disabled="@_resetSending">
                        @if (_resetSending)
                        {
                            <span class="um-spinner-sm" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                        }
                        שליחת קישור
                    </button>
                }
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
}

@* ══════════════════════════════════════════
     IMPORT WIZARD
     Rendered unconditionally; MModal itself is the IsOpen gate. Placed with
     the other overlays rather than inside .um-page so a click inside it never
     reaches the page's CloseAllMenus handler.
     ══════════════════════════════════════════ *@
<UserImportWizard IsOpen="_importOpen"
                  ExistingUsers="_allUsers"
                  OnClose="CloseImport"
                  OnImported="ReloadUsersAsync" />

@{
    // Materialized ONCE per render: the header summary, the result line, the
    // empty state and the rows all read the same list, and recomputing the
    // filter per reader would let them disagree mid-render.
    var rows = FilteredUsers.ToList();
}

<div class="um-page" dir="rtl" @onclick="CloseAllMenus">

    @* ══ Header — identity, then the two page-level actions ═══════════════ *@
    <header class="um-head">
        <div class="um-head-main">
            <MAdminBack />

            <div class="um-head-title">
                <h1 class="um-h1">ניהול משתמשים</h1>
                <MInfoTip Text="משתמשי המערכת, התפקידים שלהם וייבוא משתמשים" />
                @if (!_loading)
                {
                    <MSummaryTag Metrics="SummaryMetrics" />
                }
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="um-head-actions" @onclick:stopPropagation="true">
            @* Secondary. Opens the import wizard in place — the admin never
               leaves the table. The old CSV / XLSX / Moodle / Airtable menu is
               gone: two of its entries were no-ops and two were disabled
               placeholders, and the wizard now detects the format from the file
               itself, so a menu that asks the format up front has nothing to
               decide. *@
            <button type="button" class="um-btn-secondary" @onclick="OpenImport">
                <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                     stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4" />
                    <path d="m7 10 5 5 5-5" />
                    <path d="M12 15V3" />
                </svg>
                ייבוא משתמשים
            </button>

            @* The one primary on the page — gradient, per the shared
               .motiva-cta treatment. Geometry only lives in the stylesheet. *@
            <button type="button" class="um-btn-primary um-btn-primary--lg motiva-cta" @onclick="OpenCreate">
                <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                     stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" />
                </svg>
                הוספת משתמש
            </button>
        </div>
    </header>

    @* ══ Toolbar — one search, three filters, a conditional clear, a count ══ *@
    <div class="um-toolbar" @onclick:stopPropagation="true">

        @* Value MUST carry the @ — MSearchField.Value is a string parameter, so
           an unprefixed `Value="_searchQuery"` is a literal, and the field
           renders the field NAME as its content. *@
        <MSearchField Value="@_searchQuery"
                      ValueChanged="OnSearchChanged"
                      Placeholder="חיפוש לפי שם, אימייל או טלפון"
                      AriaLabel="חיפוש משתמשים"
                      Class="um-search" />

        @foreach (var f in BuildFilters())
        {
            var key = f.Key;
            var open = _openFilter == key;

            <div class="um-filter">
                <button type="button"
                        class="um-filter-btn @(f.IsActive ? "um-filter-btn--on" : "")"
                        @onclick="@(() => ToggleFilter(key))"
                        aria-haspopup="listbox" aria-expanded="@(open ? "true" : "false")">
                    <span class="um-filter-name">@f.Name</span>
                    <span class="um-filter-value">@f.CurrentLabel</span>
                    <svg class="um-filter-chev @(open ? "um-filter-chev--open" : "")"
                         width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                         stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                        <path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6" />
                    </svg>
                </button>

                @if (open)
                {
                    <div class="um-menu um-menu--filter" role="listbox" aria-label="@f.Name">
                        @foreach (var o in f.Options)
                        {
                            var val = o.Value;
                            var selected = o.Value == f.CurrentValue;
                            <button type="button"
                                    class="um-menu-item @(selected ? "um-menu-item--on" : "")"
                                    role="option" aria-selected="@(selected ? "true" : "false")"
                                    @onclick="@(() => PickFilter(key, val))">
                                <span class="um-menu-item-label">@o.Label</span>
                                @if (selected)
                                {
                                    <svg class="um-menu-check" width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
                                         stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round"
                                         stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                                        <path d="m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7" />
                                    </svg>
                                }
                            </button>
                        }
                    </div>
                }
            </div>
        }

        @if (HasActiveFilters)
        {
            <button type="button" class="um-clear" @onclick="ClearFilters">ניקוי סינון</button>
        }

        @if (!_loading)
        {
            <span class="um-result">@ResultLine(rows.Count)</span>
        }
    </div>

    @* ══ The table ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ *@
    <MDataTable TItem="UserForAdmin"
                Items="rows"
                Loading="_loading"
                LoadingText="טוען משתמשים…"
                ColumnCount="7"
                MinWidth="920px"
                Class="um-table">

        <Columns>
            @* Name and email carry no width on purpose: under
               table-layout:fixed the five sized columns are honoured exactly
               and the two text columns share whatever is left, so the table
               widens into the Management canvas instead of capping itself. *@
            <col />
            <col />
            <col class="um-col-role" />
            <col class="um-col-cycle" />
            <col class="um-col-phone" />
            <col class="um-col-status" />
            <col class="um-col-actions" />
        </Columns>

        <HeaderContent>
            <th scope="col">שם מלא</th>
            <th scope="col">אימייל</th>
            <th scope="col">תפקיד</th>
            <th scope="col">מחזור</th>
            <th scope="col">טלפון</th>
            <th scope="col">סטטוס</th>
            <th scope="col"><span class="um-sr">פעולות</span></th>
        </HeaderContent>

        <EmptyContent>
            <MEmptyState Title="לא נמצאו משתמשים"
                         Description="נסו לשנות את החיפוש או הסינון"
                         Live="true" />
        </EmptyContent>

        <RowTemplate Context="user">
            @{
                var role     = PrimaryRole(user);
                var fullName = FullName(user);
                var menuOpen = _openRowMenuId == user.Id;
            }
            <tr class="@(menuOpen ? "m-dt-row-active" : "")">

                <td class="um-cell-identity">
                    <span class="um-identity">
                        <span class="um-avatar" aria-hidden="true">@GetInitials(fullName)</span>
                        <span class="um-name" title="@fullName">@fullName</span>
                    </span>
                </td>

                <td class="um-cell-email" dir="ltr" title="@user.Email">@user.Email</td>

                <td>
                    <span class="um-role um-role--@RoleToneClass(role)">@RoleLabel(role)</span>
                </td>

                <td class="um-cell-quiet">@Dash(user.AcademicYear)</td>

                <td class="um-cell-quiet um-cell-phone" dir="ltr">@Dash(user.Phone)</td>

                <td>
                    @* Dot + text, not a filled pill: the status is one of two
                       values on every row, and 28 filled chips down a column
                       would out-shout the names. *@
                    <span class="um-status @(user.IsActive ? "um-status--on" : "um-status--off")">
                        <span class="um-status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                        @(user.IsActive ? "פעיל" : "לא פעיל")
                    </span>
                </td>

                <td class="um-cell-actions" @onclick:stopPropagation="true">
                    <div class="um-actions">
                        <button type="button"
                                class="um-kebab @(menuOpen ? "um-kebab--on" : "")"
                                @onclick="@(() => ToggleRowMenu(user.Id))"
                                aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="@(menuOpen ? "true" : "false")"
                                title="פעולות" aria-label="@($"פעולות עבור {fullName}")">
                            <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
                                <circle cx="12" cy="5" r="1.7" />
                                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1.7" />
                                <circle cx="12" cy="19" r="1.7" />
                            </svg>
                        </button>

                        @if (menuOpen)
                        {
                            <div class="um-menu um-menu--row" role="menu">
                                <button type="button" class="um-menu-item" role="menuitem"
                                        @onclick="@(() => EditUser(user))">
                                    <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                                         stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                                        <path d="M17 3a2.8 2.8 0 1 1 4 4L7.5 20.5 2 22l1.5-5.5Z" />
                                    </svg>
                                    עריכת פרטים
                                </button>

                                <button type="button" class="um-menu-item" role="menuitem"
                                        @onclick="@(() => OpenReset(user))">
                                    <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                                         stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                                        <rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="10" rx="2" />
                                        <path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4" />
                                    </svg>
                                    איפוס סיסמה
                                </button>

                                <button type="button" class="um-menu-item" role="menuitem"
                                        @onclick="@(() => ToggleActive(user))">
                                    <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                                         stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                                        <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" />
                                        @if (user.IsActive)
                                        {
                                            <path d="M5.6 5.6 18.4 18.4" />
                                        }
                                        else
                                        {
                                            <path d="m8.5 12.2 2.4 2.4 4.6-4.9" />
                                        }
                                    </svg>
                                    @(user.IsActive ? "השבתת משתמש" : "הפעלת משתמש")
                                </button>

                                @* NO "מחיקת משתמש". The prototype draws one,
                                   separated by a rule and coloured rose. There
                                   is no delete endpoint in the product, so the
                                   item — and the destructive section it sits
                                   in — is deliberately absent rather than
                                   rendered as an action that cannot happen. *@
                            </div>
                        }
                    </div>
                </td>
            </tr>
        </RowTemplate>
    </MDataTable>
</div>

@code {

    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    //  MSelectField Options
    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    private static readonly List<MSelect.Option> AcademicYearOptions = new()
    {
        new MSelect.Option("2024-2025", "2024-2025"),
        new MSelect.Option("2025-2026", "2025-2026"),
    };

    private static readonly List<MSelect.Option> RoleSelectOptions = new()
    {
        new MSelect.Option("Student", "סטודנט"),
        new MSelect.Option("Mentor",  "מנחה"),
        new MSelect.Option("Staff",   "מרצה / צוות"),
        new MSelect.Option("Admin",   "מנהל מערכת"),
    };

    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    //  Data — one unpaged load, exactly as before
    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    private List<UserForAdmin> _allUsers = new();
    private bool _loading = true;

    protected override async Task OnInitializedAsync()
    {
        _allUsers = await _Auth.GetUsersByRoles("") ?? new List<UserForAdmin>();
        _loading = false;
    }

    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    //  Filter / search state
    //  Client-side over the loaded list — unchanged semantics.
    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    private string _searchQuery  = "";
    private string _filterRole   = "";
    private string _filterCycle  = "2025-2026";   // default: current active cycle
    private string _filterStatus = "";

    private IEnumerable<UserForAdmin> FilteredUsers => _allUsers
        .Where(u => string.IsNullOrEmpty(_filterRole)
                    || u.Roles.Contains(_filterRole))
        .Where(u => string.IsNullOrEmpty(_filterCycle)
                    || u.AcademicYear == _filterCycle)
        .Where(u => string.IsNullOrEmpty(_filterStatus)
                    || (_filterStatus == "active"   &&  u.IsActive)
                    || (_filterStatus == "inactive" && !u.IsActive))
        .Where(u =>
        {
            if (string.IsNullOrEmpty(_searchQuery)) return true;
            var fullName = $"{u.FirstName} {u.LastName}";
            return fullName.Contains(_searchQuery,  StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase)
                || (u.Email ?? "").Contains(_searchQuery, StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase)
                || (u.Phone ?? "").Contains(_searchQuery, StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase);
        });

    private void OnSearchChanged(string value)
    {
        _searchQuery = value;
        CloseAllMenus();
    }

    // ── The toolbar's three filters ──────────────────────────────────────
    //
    // Role and cycle options are DERIVED from the loaded users, never listed
    // literally: the prototype's roles and its תשפ"ו/תשפ"ה cycles are mock, and
    // users.AcademicYear is a free-text column whose real values ("2025-2026")
    // only the data can report. Status is the one exception — `IsActive` is a
    // bool, so its two options ARE the domain.
    private sealed record FilterOption(string Value, string Label);

    private sealed record FilterDef(string Key, string Name, string CurrentValue,
                                    string CurrentLabel, bool IsActive,
                                    IReadOnlyList<FilterOption> Options);

    private const string AllValue = "";
    private const string AllLabel = "הכל";

    private IEnumerable<FilterDef> BuildFilters()
    {
        yield return MakeFilter("role", "תפקיד", _filterRole, RoleOptions());
        yield return MakeFilter("cycle", "מחזור", _filterCycle, CycleOptions());
        yield return MakeFilter("status", "סטטוס", _filterStatus, new[]
        {
            new FilterOption("active",   "פעיל"),
            new FilterOption("inactive", "לא פעיל"),
        });
    }

    private static FilterDef MakeFilter(string key, string name, string current,
                                        IEnumerable<FilterOption> options)
    {
        var all  = new[] { new FilterOption(AllValue, AllLabel) }.Concat(options).ToList();
        var here = all.FirstOrDefault(o => o.Value == current);

        return new FilterDef(
            Key:          key,
            Name:         name,
            // A value that is no longer represented in the data still has to
            // render as itself rather than silently reading as "הכל".
            CurrentValue: current,
            CurrentLabel: here?.Label ?? current,
            IsActive:     !string.IsNullOrEmpty(current),
            Options:      all);
    }

    // The canonical order the rest of the product lists roles in. "User" is the
    // approval flag, not a role, and is excluded here as it is everywhere else.
    private static readonly string[] RoleOrder =
        { Roles.Student, Roles.Mentor, Roles.Staff, Roles.Admin };

    private IEnumerable<FilterOption> RoleOptions() =>
        RoleOrder
            .Where(r => _allUsers.Any(u => u.Roles is not null && u.Roles.Contains(r)))
            .Select(r => new FilterOption(r, RoleLabel(r)));

    private IEnumerable<FilterOption> CycleOptions() =>
        _allUsers
            .Select(u => u.AcademicYear)
            .Where(y => !string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(y))
            .Distinct()
            .OrderByDescending(y => y, StringComparer.Ordinal)
            .Select(y => new FilterOption(y, y));

    private bool HasActiveFilters =>
        !string.IsNullOrEmpty(_searchQuery)
        || !string.IsNullOrEmpty(_filterRole)
        || !string.IsNullOrEmpty(_filterCycle)
        || !string.IsNullOrEmpty(_filterStatus);

    private void ClearFilters()
    {
        _searchQuery  = "";
        _filterRole   = "";
        _filterCycle  = "";
        _filterStatus = "";
        CloseAllMenus();
    }

    private void PickFilter(string key, string value)
    {
        switch (key)
        {
            case "role":   _filterRole   = value; break;
            case "cycle":  _filterCycle  = value; break;
            case "status": _filterStatus = value; break;
        }
        _openFilter = null;
    }

    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    //  Header / toolbar copy — counted, never stated
    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    /// <summary>The header's summary tag — the same two counts, as metrics.</summary>
    private IReadOnlyList<MSummaryTag.Metric> SummaryMetrics
    {
        get
        {
            var total  = _allUsers.Count;
            var active = _allUsers.Count(u => u.IsActive);
            return new[]
            {
                new MSummaryTag.Metric(total.ToString(), "משתמשים"),
                new MSummaryTag.Metric(active.ToString(), "פעילים"),
            };
        }
    }

    private string ResultLine(int shown) =>
        shown == _allUsers.Count
            ? $"מציג את כל {_allUsers.Count} המשתמשים"
            : $"מציג {shown} מתוך {_allUsers.Count}";

    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    //  Menu state — one open surface at a time
    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    private int     _openRowMenuId  = -1;
    private string? _openFilter     = null;

    private void ToggleRowMenu(int userId)
    {
        _openRowMenuId  = _openRowMenuId == userId ? -1 : userId;
        _openFilter     = null;
    }

    private void ToggleFilter(string key)
    {
        _openFilter     = _openFilter == key ? null : key;
        _openRowMenuId  = -1;
    }

    private void CloseAllMenus()
    {
        _openRowMenuId  = -1;
        _openFilter     = null;
    }

    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    //  Create user modal state
    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    private bool   _createOpen    = false;
    private string _createFirstName = "";
    private string _createLastName  = "";
    private string _createEmail     = "";
    private string _createPhone     = "";
    private string _createYear      = "2025-2026";
    private string _createRole      = "Student";
    private string _createError     = "";
    private bool   _createSaving    = false;
    private bool   _createSuccess   = false;

    private void OpenCreate()
    {
        _createOpen      = true;
        _createFirstName = "";
        _createLastName  = "";
        _createEmail     = "";
        _createPhone     = "";
        _createYear      = "2025-2026";
        _createRole      = "Student";
        _createError     = "";
        _createSuccess   = false;
        _createSaving    = false;
        CloseAllMenus();
    }

    private void CancelCreate()
    {
        if (_createSaving) return;
        _createOpen    = false;
        _createError   = "";
        _createSuccess = false;
    }

    private async Task SaveCreate()
    {
        _createError   = "";
        _createSuccess = false;

        if (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(_createFirstName))
        { _createError = "יש להזין שם פרטי"; return; }

        if (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(_createLastName))
        { _createError = "יש להזין שם משפחה"; return; }

        if (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(_createEmail))
        { _createError = "יש להזין כתובת מייל"; return; }

        if (!_createEmail.Contains('@') || !_createEmail.Contains('.'))
        { _createError = "כתובת מייל לא תקינה"; return; }

        _createSaving = true;

        var newUser = new UserAddedByAdmin
        {
            FirstName    = _createFirstName.Trim(),
            LastName     = _createLastName.Trim(),
            Email        = _createEmail.Trim().ToLower(),
            Phone        = _createPhone.Trim(),
            AcademicYear = _createYear,
            Role         = _createRole,
        };

        var result = await _Auth.AdminAddUser(newUser);
        _createSaving = false;

        if (result is null)
        {
            _createError = "שגיאה בלתי צפויה";
            return;
        }

        if (result.Result != AuthResults.Success)
        {
            _createError = result.Result switch
            {
                AuthResults.Exists          => "כתובת המייל כבר קיימת במערכת",
                AuthResults.EmailFailed     => "המשתמש נוצר אך שליחת המייל נכשלה",
                AuthResults.CreateUserFailed => "יצירת המשתמש נכשלה",
                _                           => result.Result
            };
            // EmailFailed is a partial success — user was created
            if (result.Result == AuthResults.EmailFailed && result.User is not null)
            {
                AddCreatedUserToList(result.User, newUser);
                _createSuccess = true;
            }
            return;
        }

        AddCreatedUserToList(result.User, newUser);
        _createSuccess = true;

        // Auto-close after a short visual confirmation
        await Task.Delay(1200);
        _createOpen    = false;
        _createSuccess = false;
    }

    private void AddCreatedUserToList(UserForAdmin serverUser, UserAddedByAdmin form)
    {
        // Use server-returned id; fill in form values the server doesn't echo back
        serverUser.Phone        = form.Phone;
        serverUser.AcademicYear = form.AcademicYear;
        if (!serverUser.Roles.Contains(form.Role))
            serverUser.Roles.Add(form.Role);
        serverUser.IsActive = true;
        _allUsers.Insert(0, serverUser);
    }

    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    //  Edit modal state
    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    private UserForAdmin? _editUser    = null;
    private string        _editFirstName = "";
    private string        _editLastName  = "";
    private string        _editPhone     = "";
    private string        _editYear      = "";
    private string        _editRole      = "";
    private string        _editError     = "";
    private bool          _editSaving    = false;

    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    //  Row actions
    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────

    // ── Import ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    //
    // The wizard owns parsing, mapping, validation and duplicate resolution;
    // this page owns only whether it is open and what the current user set is.
    // It writes through AdminAddUser / UpdateUserAsync — the SAME two calls the
    // create and edit modals above make — so there is no second write path into
    // the users table and no server change behind this feature.
    private bool _importOpen;

    private void OpenImport()
    {
        CloseAllMenus();
        _importOpen = true;
    }

    private void CloseImport() => _importOpen = false;

    /// <summary>Re-reads the list after a run. A refetch rather than a local
    /// patch: an import can create, merge AND replace in one pass, and the
    /// server is the only thing that knows what actually landed — including
    /// the roles the UserRoles triggers added on its own (Staff implies Admin).
    /// </summary>
    private async Task ReloadUsersAsync()
    {
        _loading = true;
        StateHasChanged();

        _allUsers = await _Auth.GetUsersByRoles("") ?? new List<UserForAdmin>();
        _loading  = false;
    }

    // UI-ONLY, AND STILL IS. `users.IsActive` is returned by GET api/Admin and
    // rendered as the status column, but nothing in the product writes it:
    // AdminController exposes roles / AddUser / UpdateUser / GetAllUsers and no
    // activation endpoint. Flipping this affects the current page only and is
    // lost on reload. Left exactly as found rather than silently "fixed" with
    // a new API — see the summary that shipped with this redesign.
    private void ToggleActive(UserForAdmin user)
    {
        user.IsActive  = !user.IsActive;
        _openRowMenuId = -1;
    }

    private void EditUser(UserForAdmin user)
    {
        CloseAllMenus();
        _editUser       = user;
        _editFirstName  = user.FirstName ?? "";
        _editLastName   = user.LastName  ?? "";
        _editPhone      = user.Phone     ?? "";
        _editYear       = user.AcademicYear ?? "2025-2026";
        _editRole       = user.Roles.FirstOrDefault(r => r != Roles.User) ?? Roles.Student;
        _editError      = "";
        _editSaving     = false;
    }

    private void CancelEdit()
    {
        if (_editSaving) return;
        _editUser  = null;
        _editError = "";
    }

    private async Task SaveEdit()
    {
        if (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(_editFirstName) || string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(_editLastName))
        {
            _editError = "שם פרטי ושם משפחה הם שדות חובה";
            return;
        }

        _editSaving = true;
        _editError  = "";

        var req = new AdminUpdateUserRequest
        {
            FirstName    = _editFirstName.Trim(),
            LastName     = _editLastName.Trim(),
            Phone        = _editPhone.Trim(),
            AcademicYear = _editYear,
            Role         = _editRole,
        };

        var error = await _Auth.UpdateUserAsync(_editUser!.Id, req);

        if (error is not null)
        {
            _editError  = error;
            _editSaving = false;
            return;
        }

        // Reflect changes locally so the table updates immediately
        _editUser.FirstName    = req.FirstName;
        _editUser.LastName     = req.LastName;
        _editUser.Phone        = req.Phone;
        _editUser.AcademicYear = req.AcademicYear;

        // Replace primary role in the local roles list (keep "User" if present)
        _editUser.Roles.RemoveAll(r => r != Roles.User);
        if (!_editUser.Roles.Contains(req.Role))
            _editUser.Roles.Add(req.Role);

        _editSaving = false;
        _editUser   = null;
    }

    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    //  Reset password — the EXISTING ForgotPassword flow, invoked from here
    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    private UserForAdmin? _resetUser    = null;
    private bool          _resetSending = false;
    private string        _resetError   = "";
    private string        _resetSuccess = "";

    private void OpenReset(UserForAdmin user)
    {
        CloseAllMenus();
        _resetUser    = user;
        _resetSending = false;
        _resetError   = "";
        _resetSuccess = "";
    }

    private void CloseReset()
    {
        if (_resetSending) return;
        _resetUser    = null;
        _resetError   = "";
        _resetSuccess = "";
    }

    private async Task SendReset()
    {
        _resetSending = true;
        _resetError   = "";
        _resetSuccess = "";

        // Same call and same result switch as AuthPages/ForgetPassword.razor —
        // one flow, invoked from a second place, not a second implementation.
        var result = await _Auth.ForgetPassword(new ForgetPasswordDTO { Email = _resetUser!.Email });

        switch (result)
        {
            case AuthResults.Success:
                _resetSuccess = $"קישור לאיפוס הסיסמה נשלח אל {_resetUser.Email}";
                break;
            case AuthResults.UserNotFound:
                _resetError = "לא קיים משתמש בכתובת זו";
                break;
            default:
                _resetError = "שליחת הקישור נכשלה";
                break;
        }

        _resetSending = false;
    }

    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    //  Display helpers
    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────

    /// <summary>The role a row is labelled by. "User" is the approval flag, not
    /// a role — the same exclusion EditUser has always made.</summary>
    private static string PrimaryRole(UserForAdmin u) =>
        u.Roles?.FirstOrDefault(r => r != Roles.User) ?? "";

    private static string FullName(UserForAdmin u) =>
        $"{u.FirstName} {u.LastName}".Trim();

    private static string RoleLabel(string role) => role switch
    {
        Roles.Student => "סטודנט",
        Roles.Mentor  => "מנחה",
        Roles.Staff   => "מרצה",
        "Lecturer"    => "מרצה",
        Roles.Admin   => "מנהל מערכת",
        ""            => "—",
        _             => role
    };

    /// <summary>Maps a role onto one of the four tag treatments. Categorical,
    /// not semantic: the Master's violet/teal/rose set means progress and
    /// attention, and a role is neither — so the tags stay tints, rose is not
    /// used at all here, and Admin gets the brand edge rather than a fifth
    /// invented hue.</summary>
    private static string RoleToneClass(string role) => role switch
    {
        Roles.Student           => "student",
        Roles.Mentor            => "mentor",
        Roles.Staff or "Lecturer" => "staff",
        Roles.Admin             => "admin",
        _                       => "none"
    };

    /// <summary>17 of 28 seeded users have no phone, and most have no cycle
    /// history — an em dash says "not recorded" where an empty cell just looks
    /// like a rendering bug.</summary>
    private static string Dash(string? value) =>
        string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(value) ? "—" : value;

    private static string GetInitials(string name)
    {
        if (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(name)) return "?";
        var parts = name.Split(' ', StringSplitOptions.RemoveEmptyEntries);
        return parts.Length >= 2
            ? $"{parts[0][0]}{parts[1][0]}"
            : parts[0][0].ToString();
    }
}
